      "title": "Notification Hub webhook failing to trigger in EU-West production",
      "description": "We are experiencing issues with our Notification Hub integration in the EU-West region. Specifically, webhooks are not firing as expected when events occur. Additionally, when we attempt to manually query the API for these events, we receive an empty response object. This started occurring around 08:00 UTC today. No other regions seem to be affected."
    },
    {
      "i": 8971,
      "title": "Payment Gateway v2 charges declining and chargebacks due to stale cache",
      "description": "Our Payment Gateway v2 instance in EU-Central is rejecting valid payments, resulting in multiple chargeback notices being received by merchants. We have about 92 users currently impacted. This is definitely a stale cache problem on your end because the card data seems to be cached incorrectly, causing the decline logic to fail. Please clear the cache immediately to resolve these declines."
    },
    {
      "i": 8972,
      "title": "Subscription charged twice in staging environment",
      "description": "In our US-West staging environment, we are observing that subscriptions are being charged twice. This happens intermittently during the renewal simulation process. Approximately 5 test users have reported duplicate charges in their transaction logs. The impact is low as it is staging, but it is blocking our QA verification for the new billing module."
    },
    {
      "i": 8973,
      "title": "Overcharge issue in sandbox - unclear if payment or login related",
      "description": "We are seeing an overcharge in our US-East sandbox environment. The user was charged more than the agreed amount. However, we are also noticing some strange behavior when logging in via the SSO Broker; sometimes the session doesn't persist correctly. We aren't sure if the overcharge is a direct result of the payment logic failing after a re-authentication event, or if these are two separate issues. It's hard to tell which system is actually at fault here."
    },
    {
      "i": 8974,
      "title": "Queue Manager down in EU-Central",
      "description": "Our Queue Manager in EU-Central seems to be having problems. We are getting reports of partial and maybe full outages. The health checks are failing. It's affecting a lot of users, probably around 368. Can you please check? We need this fixed ASAP."
    },
    {
      "i": 8975,
      "title": "Help Center password reset links expiring early and SSO errors",
      "description": "Users in the APAC region are reporting that password reset links sent from the Help Center are expired immediately upon receipt, preventing them from regaining access. Furthermore, when attempting to log in via the standard SSO route, users are encountering an error page instead of being redirected. This is affecting approximately 46 users and has a moderate impact on our support operations."
    },
    {
      "i": 8976,
      "title": "SSO Integration Module: MFA prompts missing and sessions expiring early in Staging",
      "description": "In our US-West staging environment, the SSO Integration Module is not presenting the Multi-Factor Authentication (MFA) prompt during login, allowing direct access. Additionally, users are experiencing unexpected session expirations much sooner than the configured timeout. This is impacting our ability to test security compliance flows. No business impact on production, but critical for our QA sign-off."
    },
    {
      "i": 8977,
      "title": "OAuth Service showing elevated privileges in EU-West",
      "description": "We have observed that users accessing our applications via OAuth in the EU-West region are displaying elevated privileges that they should not have. This seems to be an issue with the OAuth Service token generation or validation. We haven't seen specific user reports yet, but this is a security concern we need to address immediately."
    },
    {
      "i": 8978,
      "title": "Analytics Dashboard timeouts and webhook failures in US-East Staging",
      "description": "Our Analytics Dashboard in the US-East staging environment is consistently timing out when we try to load complex reports. Concurrently, the webhooks configured to push data to our external systems are not firing. This is causing a backlog of unprocessed data and is blocking our development team from proceeding with the next sprint. Approximately 705 users are affected in this pre-production test group."
    },
    {
      "i": 8979,
      "title": "Sandbox SSO Integration Module down - vendor incident reported",
      "description": "The SSO Integration Module in our Middle East sandbox environment is not functioning. Upon checking the vendor status page, there is an active incident logged for this service. This is preventing our team from conducting necessary integration tests. The impact is high as we are currently in a critical phase of validation with 658 users waiting for access."
    },
    {
      "i": 8980,
      "title": "Rate Limiter causing 504 errors and connection refusals in EU-Central",
      "description": "In the EU-Central production environment, our Rate Limiter service is returning HTTP 504 Gateway Timeout errors and occasionally refusing connections entirely. This is impacting about 36 users who are unable to complete their requests. The issue seems to correlate with peak traffic hours. We need assistance investigating why the limiter is failing to handle the load or is misconfigured."
    },
    {
      "i": 8981,
      "title": "Payment Gateway v2 issues in APAC Dev",
      "description": "We have some weird behavior in our APAC development environment with Payment Gateway v2. There is a flag mismatch on data residency, the retention policy isn't working right, and the audit logs have gaps. Just letting you know."
    },
    {
      "i": 8982,
      "title": "User provisioning stuck in SSO Integration Module EU-West",
      "description": "The SSO Integration Module in EU-West production is failing to complete user provisioning tasks. Accounts are being created but the provisioning process gets stuck in a 'pending' state and never finalizes. This is severely impacting our onboarding process, with 379 users unable to access critical systems. Immediate resolution is required."
    },
    {
      "i": 8983,
      "title": "Critical SSO/Lifecycle issues in ANZ Sandbox: Lockouts and MFA failures",
      "description": "We are experiencing critical failures in our ANZ sandbox environment. Users are getting locked out of their accounts unexpectedly, sessions are expiring without notice, and the MFA prompt is not appearing. We are unsure if this is a configuration issue within the SSO Integration Module itself or if the Identity Lifecycle Manager is incorrectly triggering these lockouts and session terminations. With 1325 users affected, we cannot determine which component is the root cause."
    },
    {
      "i": 8984,
      "title": "Wallet Service: Undercharges and duplicate transactions in ANZ Staging",
      "description": "In the ANZ staging environment, the Wallet Service is exhibiting inconsistent transaction behavior. Some users are reporting that transactions are undercharged compared to the expected amount, while others are seeing duplicate charges for a single transaction. This is affecting approximately 1744 users and is a critical blocker for our payment release readiness. Please investigate the transaction processing logic."
    }
